{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34364","headline":"袭美以春橘见惠兼之雅篇因次韵酬谢 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美以春橘见惠兼之雅篇因次韵酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"到春犹作九秋鲜，应是亲封白帝烟。\n良玉有浆须让味，明珠无纇亦羞圆。\n堪居汉苑霜梨上，合在仙家火枣前。\n珍重更过三十子，不堪分付野人边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}